@host = http://localhost:5132
@invoiceId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_INVOICE_ID

### Cargar una factura real (Rider HTTP Client)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/invoices
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=VankooBoundary

--VankooBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mypeId"

11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
--VankooBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="factura.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:/ruta/a/factura.pdf
--VankooBoundary--

### Procesar OCR y obtener extracción + consistencia
POST {{host}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/ocr/sync

### Consultar el estado y resultado persistido
GET {{host}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Eliminar una factura y su archivo
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}

### Eliminar todas las facturas y sus archivos (solo Development)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/invoices?confirm=true
